First run `git merge --ff-only feat/native-port-ai-audio`. Read `desktop/gpui/ARCHITECTURE.md` and `PORT_PLAN.md`, but verify everything in code; PORT_PLAN's claims are not evidence.

**Your group: window chrome and navigation.**
- masthead, drawer, Home, House, Library/folio list, collections, account menu, file menu;
- every section of Settings (`src/routes/settings/index.tsx` and `src/components/settings/**`), and theme/appearance presets;
- toasts and notices, sign-in prompts, global keyboard shortcuts, route transitions;
- empty, loading, error and offline states for all of the above.
