- a visible element or control;
- a state: empty, loading, error, offline, signed-in/out, hover, focus, active, disabled, narrow;
- an interaction: click, keyboard shortcut, drag, context menu, focus order;
- user-facing copy, an animation or transition, or a persistence behaviour.
